    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d173">

                <pb facs="0274" n="227" xml:id="pg227"/>

                <head>173. Telegram 696 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d173-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-09-08">September 8, 1955, 6:01
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d173-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d173-1"/>
                <p>696. For Johnson. Department’s 678.</p>
                <p>Immigration Naturalization Service reports 90 Chinese left Honolulu for Far East
                    between July 11 August 31 inclusive. Total departures given next to last
                    paragraph should be changed to 173.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Hoover</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
